@startuml
title ATM Control - Withdrawal Scenario

[*] --> WaitingForInput

state "Waiting for Input" as WaitingForInput
[*] --> WaitingForInput : start event
WaitingForInput --> ChoosingAmount : User chooses option
...

WaitingForInput --> CancelledTransaction : User cancels transaction
CancelledTransaction --> ReturnCard : System returns card
ReturnCard --> [*] : end event
@enduml
